9
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,060
Yeah.

10
00:01:00,198 --> 00:01:01,440
Yeah, it was fun.

11
00:01:14,488 --> 00:01:16,248
You know, I think that guy
really liked me.

12
00:01:16,869 --> 00:01:17,629
Who?

13
00:01:17,767 --> 00:01:18,595
Brad?

14
00:01:18,906 --> 00:01:20,459
No. Martin?

15
00:01:20,735 --> 00:01:23,013
It's Martine.
And no, the other guy.

16
00:01:24,256 --> 00:01:26,224
I could not keep
up with them all.

17
00:01:37,407 --> 00:01:38,995
Rick, that was his name!

18
00:01:39,133 --> 00:01:43,137
Oh, God! The guy who said
