23
00:01:58,359 --> 00:02:01,638
Oh! Do you have to have a
license to be a race car driver?

24
00:02:02,743 --> 00:02:03,606
Yeah.

25
00:02:13,788 --> 00:02:14,720
Wow!

26
00:02:15,825 --> 00:02:17,137
Your mom was right.

27
00:02:17,447 --> 00:02:18,414
It's beautiful.

28
