We did that yesterday.

35
00:03:15,988 --> 00:03:17,714
Today is last day of vacation.

36
00:03:17,921 --> 00:03:19,647
Let's just hang out
for a couple more hours.

37
00:03:20,303 --> 00:03:21,615
I don't want to go either.

38
00:03:22,650 --> 00:03:25,481
- Let's just stay here
and get drunk.
- I'm already drunk.

39
00:03:25,757 --> 00:03:27,068
We don't have any more money.

40
00:03:27,207 --> 00:03:28,587
You can just come
back at spring break.

41
00:03:29,209 --> 00:03:31,349
You lie so much.

42
00:04:23,608 --> 00:04:26,507
I would love to buy an old house
like this someday and fix it up.

43
00:04:27,128 --> 00:04:29,234
That's a lot of fixing.

44
00:04:29,372 --> 00:04:31,443
You're the laziest
person in the world.

45
00:04:31,581 --> 00:04:32,858
You can't fix shit.

46
00:04:32,996 --> 00:04:35,102
I would hire someone of course.

47
00:04:35,654 --> 00:04:36,931
With what money?

48
00:04:43,248 --> 00:04:44,076
Guys?

49
00:04:44,284 --> 00:04:45,112
Nikki?

50
00:04:45,354 --> 00:04:46,838
Jess?

51
00:04:47,977 --> 00:04:49,150
Oh, my God.

52
00:04:50,773 --> 00:04:52,982
That wasn't there
before when we walked by.

53
00:04:54,673 --> 00:04:55,985
I don't remember seeing it.

54
00:04:56,330 --> 00:04:57,055
Me neither.

55
00:04:57,435 --> 00:04:59,022
We should call the police.

56
00:04:59,540 --> 00:05:00,300
Yeah.

57
00:05:09,826 --> 00:05:11,311
<i>911,
state your emergency.</i>

58
00:05:11,449 --> 00:05:14,624
Hi, my name's Jess,
Jessica Campbell.

59
00:05:15,211 --> 00:05:18,041
We're outside a beach house
on the coastal highway

60
00:05:18,352 --> 00:05:20,216
and we think
something bad has happened here.

61
00:05:34,057 --> 00:05:36,957
There's something written
on the side of the house.

62
00:05:37,302 --> 00:05:39,339
<i>Okay, tell me,
what does it say?</i>

63
00:05:44,516 --> 00:05:45,897
<i>Do you have the address?</i>

64
00:05:46,553 --> 00:05:47,519
Where are we?

65
00:05:47,657 --> 00:05:48,589
I don't know.

66
00:05:49,659 --> 00:05:51,523
<i>Is there anyone
inside the house?</i>

67
00:05:52,006 --> 00:05:55,182
It's empty.
I don't think anyone lives here.

68
00:06:17,169 --> 00:06:21,173
Okay, Jess,
we're going to have you stay on
the line

69
00:06:21,484 --> 00:06:22,243
<i>Stand by.</i>

70
00:06:26,178 --> 00:06:27,214
What is that?

71
00:06:37,535 --> 00:06:38,536
Let's go.

72
00:06:39,847 --> 00:06:40,883
Jess!

73
00:06:44,438 --> 00:06:45,819
