74
00:06:46,544 --> 00:06:48,442
What the fuck are
you guys doing?

75
00:07:19,956 --> 00:07:21,302
We gotta get out of here now.

76
00:07:21,682 --> 00:07:22,821
Let's go out the window.

77
00:07:39,804 --> 00:07:43,773
No one is so fierce that you
dare to start a serpent.

78
00:07:44,878 --> 00:07:47,639
Who then is here who can
stand before me?

79
00:07:52,057 --> 00:07:53,680
We need to find
something to break it!

80
00:08:14,321 --> 00:08:15,909
Jess! Jess!

81
00:08:17,704 --> 00:08:18,670
Jess!

82
00:08:20,292 --> 00:08:22,156
Please! Please, help me!

83
00:08:23,675 --> 00:08:26,195
Jess, please! Please, help me!

84
00:11:05,216 --> 00:11:06,286
Help!

85
00:11:10,152 --> 00:11:12,257
Help... anyone!

86
00:11:16,054 --> 00:11:17,400
Anyone here?

87
00:12:37,722 --> 00:12:38,930
Oh Jesus.

88
00:12:39,586 --> 00:12:40,794
Oh fuck!

89
00:12:43,555 --> 00:12:45,350
I told you we should've stopped
at that gas station.

90
00:12:45,488 --> 00:12:46,282
What is it?

91
00:12:46,973 --> 00:12:47,905
Fuck.

92
00:12:48,733 --> 00:12:50,873
Okay, let it cool down
for a little bit.

93
00:12:51,011 --> 00:12:52,772
Then we can go back to the gas
station and find a mechanic or
something.

94
00:12:53,186 --> 00:12:54,463
How far away was it?

95
00:12:54,601 --> 00:12:58,156
Uh, it's five miles
back that way.

96
00:12:58,881 --> 00:13:00,641
Fuck! We're never
gonna make it there.

97
00:13:05,750 --> 00:13:08,028
Okay, look,
is it an engine thing?

98
00:13:08,166 --> 00:13:09,719
Maybe it's the cooler?
What are we doing with it?

99
00:13:09,858 --> 00:13:11,307
I don't know, man,
it's fucking hot.

100
00:13:11,825 --> 00:13:12,584
You, guys!

101
00:13:13,413 --> 00:13:15,104
Help me!

102
00:13:15,933 --> 00:13:16,865
Help me!

103
00:13:19,143 --> 00:13:20,454
You have to help me.

104
00:13:20,592 --> 00:13:21,697
- What happened?
- He killed my friends.

105
00:13:21,835 --> 00:13:23,147
What are you talking about?

106
00:13:23,803 --> 00:13:27,013
My... my friends and I...
We were at the beach.

107
00:13:27,151 --> 00:13:29,360
We went
to this house...

108
00:13:30,188 --> 00:13:33,122
- They are
all dead.
- What?

109
00:13:33,882 --> 00:13:35,159
What are you talking about?

110
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:37,023
We gotta go now.

111
00:13:37,161 --> 00:13:38,852
- We can't. The fans are--
- You don't understand.

112
00:13:39,888 --> 00:13:41,096
He's gonna kill us all.

113
00:13:44,306 --> 00:13:45,272
Andy!

114
00:13:45,410 --> 00:13:47,067
What?

115
00:13:47,343 --> 00:13:49,656
Oh, my God! We have to go! Come
on, come on, let's go, let's go!

116
00:13:49,794 --> 00:13:50,657
Get in the van!

117
00:13:52,452 --> 00:13:54,143
Oh, my God!

118
00:13:56,663 --> 00:13:58,216
- David!
- I know!

119
00:14:01,668 --> 00:14:03,014
Hurry! Start the car, David!

120
00:14:03,152 --> 00:14:04,015
Come on, start!

121
00:14:05,534 --> 00:14:07,225
Come on, let's go, let's go!

122
00:14:09,331 --> 00:14:10,090
Oh my god!

123
00:14:59,381 --> 00:15:01,176
Is that the guy
that killed your friends?

124
00:15:03,592 --> 00:15:04,386
Yeah.

125
00:15:05,352 --> 00:15:06,629
What are we supposed to do now?

126
00:15:06,940 --> 00:15:08,493
Just keep driving, okay?

127
00:15:08,631 --> 00:15:10,392
Call 911 and tell
the police to meet us

128
00:15:10,530 --> 00:15:11,980
at that gas station
you were talking about.

129
00:15:12,773 --> 00:15:14,879
- How far away is it?
- It says it's straight ahead.

130
00:15:17,744 --> 00:15:19,435
Where are we?

131
00:15:20,022 --> 00:15:21,817
No, I shouldn't have come on
this trip. What the fuck was
I thinking?

132
00:15:22,749 --> 00:15:24,578
No, it's okay.

133
00:15:24,716 --> 00:15:26,580
It's okay. Let's just
get to the gas station.

134
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:28,099
That's not gonna happen.

135
00:15:28,306 --> 00:15:29,790
I knew we should take my truck.

136
00:15:29,929 --> 00:15:31,654
We weren't gonna fit.
I told you that.

137
00:15:32,138 --> 00:15:33,760
I called the cops.
They're on their way.

138
00:15:33,898 --> 00:15:35,003
Fuck!

139
00:15:35,417 --> 00:15:36,936
The van's overheating again.

140
00:15:37,419 --> 00:15:38,765
Just, just pull over there.

141
00:15:39,076 --> 00:15:40,387
Fuck, fuck, fuck.

142
00:15:58,543 --> 00:16:00,131
Are you sure
we should stop here?

143
00:16:01,029 --> 00:16:02,340
We don't have much of a choice.

144
00:16:03,031 --> 00:16:05,274
Let's just stay here
until the cops come.

145
00:16:23,327 --> 00:16:24,880
We have company.

146
00:16:31,749 --> 00:16:32,646
David?

147
00:16:33,302 --> 00:16:34,303
David, start the car.

148
00:16:47,247 --> 00:16:48,731
What the fuck is he even doing?

149
00:17:21,178 --> 00:17:22,731
That was fucking weird, right?

150
00:17:22,972 --> 00:17:24,767
Yeah, you think?

151
00:17:24,905 --> 00:17:26,217
I'm gonna call the cops and
tell them exactly where we are.

152
00:17:41,750 --> 00:17:43,234
We're gonna have to stop here.

153
00:17:44,097 --> 00:17:45,340
Dude, why are we stopping?

154
00:17:45,478 --> 00:17:47,169
It's too fucking hot,
it's not working!

155
00:17:47,307 --> 00:17:49,378
I just called the cops,
let's just fucking stay here!

156
00:17:49,516 --> 00:17:50,897
Yeah, let's just wait here.

157
00:17:51,104 --> 00:17:53,279
I don't
think that's a good idea.

158
00:17:57,973 --> 00:17:58,801
Samara!

159
00:18:02,081 --> 00:18:03,565
Get out!

160
00:18:11,262 --> 00:18:12,470
Get out! Get out!

161
00:18:13,782 --> 00:18:16,474
Go, go, go!

162
00:18:18,649 --> 00:18:22,101
Go, go, go!

163
00:18:36,667 --> 00:18:37,564
I don't see him.

164
00:18:49,852 --> 00:18:51,613
He just killed her.
He just killed her.

165
00:18:51,751 --> 00:18:52,683
Yeah, let her go.

166
00:18:52,821 --> 00:18:54,133
Okay, we gotta stay still.

167
00:18:54,340 --> 00:18:56,100
- He fucking killed her.
- Yeah, leave her.

168
00:19:01,450 --> 00:19:02,727
Phone.

169
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:05,040
- Does anyone have a phone?
- Huh?

170
00:19:06,145 --> 00:19:07,007
Mine was in the van.

171
00:19:07,594 --> 00:19:08,354
Fuck!

172
00:19:42,526 --> 00:19:43,389
That's him.

173
00:19:46,875 --> 00:19:48,566
We gotta keep moving... now.

174
00:19:49,084 --> 00:19:49,878
Okay.

175
00:20:18,700 --> 00:20:19,908
I think we lost him.

176
00:20:21,634 --> 00:20:22,980
Come on, this way.

177
00:20:24,602 --> 00:20:25,741
This is her fault.

178
00:20:31,644 --> 00:20:32,921
What did you say?

179
00:20:33,508 --> 00:20:35,441
None of this would have happened
if it wasn't for you.

180
00:20:35,579 --> 00:20:37,097
Hey, you better calm down.

181
00:20:37,339 --> 00:20:39,583
If you don't, we're all gonna
end up like Samara, okay?

182
00:20:40,239 --> 00:20:41,032
Let's go.

183
00:20:43,345 --> 00:20:44,104
Claire!

184
00:20:47,142 --> 00:20:48,764
I don't know if
I can go on, man.

185
00:20:51,319 --> 00:20:52,389
No, no, you have to.

186
00:20:54,874 --> 00:20:55,944
Samara would want you to, okay?

187
00:20:56,462 --> 00:20:59,085
and if you stay here
that guy's gonna get us.

188
00:20:59,223 --> 00:21:01,225
Samara didn't even want to come
on this trip.

189
00:21:01,777 --> 00:21:02,778
I made her.

190
00:21:04,849 --> 00:21:05,816
Don't you see?

191
00:21:07,507 --> 00:21:08,336
We have to.

192
00:21:09,475 --> 00:21:11,166
We have to. I mean get help.

193
00:21:11,546 --> 00:21:13,755
Maybe someone that can
help us find her.

194
00:21:14,307 --> 00:21:16,413
She's still out there,
right? Right?

195
00:21:16,654 --> 00:21:18,277
I don't know, man.

196
00:21:19,278 --> 00:21:22,108
She is. Just keep going right,
keep going.

197
00:21:26,112 --> 00:21:27,182
Right?

198
00:21:35,328 --> 00:21:36,122
Okay.

199
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:38,055
Okay.

200
00:22:05,427 --> 00:22:08,913
No one is so fierce that you
dare to start a serpent.

201
00:22:18,958 --> 00:22:20,200
Who then is he?

202
00:22:25,067 --> 00:22:26,724
Okay, stay for me.

203
00:23:16,740 --> 00:23:17,672
I'm Claire.

204
00:23:18,155 --> 00:23:19,294
That's Andy and David.

205
00:23:21,261 --> 00:23:22,124
I'm Jess.

206
00:23:23,954 --> 00:23:25,127
It's nice to meet you, Jess.

207
00:23:29,822 --> 00:23:31,237
So what happened
to your friends?

208
00:23:33,584 --> 00:23:36,242
We were here on
vacation at the beach.

209
00:23:37,761 --> 00:23:41,558
We were walking back to our car
and passed a house with writing
on the side.

210
00:23:42,559 --> 00:23:45,009
We stopped and
I called the police.

211
00:23:46,286 --> 00:23:47,529
What was written on the side?

212
00:23:52,085 --> 00:23:53,224
Three dead inside.

213
00:23:53,915 --> 00:23:55,779
Why the hell did you go in?

214
00:23:56,124 --> 00:23:58,506
My friends went in and
I followed them to get them out.

215
00:23:59,955 --> 00:24:01,129
Then we were attacked.

216
00:24:01,957 --> 00:24:02,889
Jesus Christ.

217
00:24:04,753 --> 00:24:07,998
He murdered both my friends
and fed them to an alligator.

218
00:24:14,694 --> 00:24:16,455
I'm sorry to hear
about your friends.

219
00:24:20,148 --> 00:24:23,634
I just, I keep thinking of ways
that I could have saved them.

220
00:24:25,705 --> 00:24:27,535
Something that I could
have done different.

221
00:24:29,675 --> 00:24:31,193
But it all happened so fast.

222
00:24:32,401 --> 00:24:34,162
We were supposed to
leave yesterday,

223
00:24:34,921 --> 00:24:36,854
but we all decided to
stay an extra day.

224
00:24:38,338 --> 00:24:40,479
Because we were
having so much fun.

225
00:24:41,997 --> 00:24:43,343
I wish we would have left.

226
00:24:44,862 --> 00:24:46,692
Maybe, I don't know, maybe...

227
00:24:48,210 --> 00:24:49,936
I would still have my friends.

228
00:27:48,977 --> 00:27:51,221
I feel like we're
walking in circles here.

229
00:27:53,223 --> 00:27:53,879
Yup!

230
00:27:55,328 --> 00:27:56,985
Maybe we should just
go back that way.

231
00:27:58,677 --> 00:27:59,539
I see something.

232
00:28:00,333 --> 00:28:01,231
It's a road.

233
00:28:10,585 --> 00:28:11,690
This way.

234
00:28:17,212 --> 00:28:18,075
Hot.

235
00:28:20,733 --> 00:28:22,217
So, where are you from?

236
00:28:23,425 --> 00:28:25,220
- Missouri.
- Oh, nice.

237
00:28:26,256 --> 00:28:27,050
Yeah.

238
00:28:28,948 --> 00:28:31,088
- So you're enjoying
Florida so far?
- Andy!

239
00:28:36,369 --> 00:28:37,198
So...

240
00:28:38,130 --> 00:28:39,441
Where are you all from?

241
00:28:40,097 --> 00:28:41,271
Up north.

242
00:28:41,720 --> 00:28:43,860
We were taking a trip
to see Ginny Springs.

243
00:28:45,447 --> 00:28:47,104
A surprise birthday
camping trip.

244
00:28:47,760 --> 00:28:49,969
Oh... Whose birthday?

245
00:28:50,452 --> 00:28:51,488
My girlfriend's.

246
00:28:53,352 --> 00:28:54,249
Samara.

247
00:29:00,117 --> 00:29:01,256
I'm sorry.

248
00:29:13,890 --> 00:29:16,927
Can I get a hallelujah, guys?
Come on.

249
00:29:17,065 --> 00:29:17,963
Hell yeah.

250
00:29:20,034 --> 00:29:21,483
- Wait.
- What?

251
00:29:22,899 --> 00:29:24,176
- Nothing.
- Come on.

252
00:30:01,765 --> 00:30:02,904
Oh, come on.

253
00:30:04,803 --> 00:30:06,839
Hello?

254
00:30:07,736 --> 00:30:08,910
Hello?

255
00:30:09,048 --> 00:30:09,877
Oh, come on.

256
00:30:12,707 --> 00:30:13,535
Hello?

257
00:30:15,227 --> 00:30:16,297
Let's try around the back.

258
00:30:32,623 --> 00:30:33,555
Hello!

259
00:30:42,495 --> 00:30:43,703
What are you doing?

260
00:30:45,913 --> 00:30:46,983
Let's go in.

261
00:30:47,535 --> 00:30:49,709
Let's just wait and see
if anyone shows up.

262
00:30:52,678 --> 00:30:53,541
We need help.

263
00:30:54,300 --> 00:30:55,025
Church.

264
00:30:55,819 --> 00:30:56,716
He's right.

265
00:30:57,579 --> 00:30:58,339
Thanks.

266
00:31:21,189 --> 00:31:22,328
Hello?

267
00:31:23,847 --> 00:31:25,193
I don't think anyone's here.

268
00:31:33,581 --> 00:31:36,101
- Can I help you?
- Yes, please someone's coming
after us.

269
00:31:36,239 --> 00:31:38,724
- He killed our friends!
We need help!
